15
00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:47.673
And give your mom a squeeze for me.

16
00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:48.924
Oh. Yeah. will do.

17
00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:50.676
- Here you go. ma'am.
- Thank you.

18
00:00:50.759 --> 00:00:51.760
Of course.

19
00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:53.595
