33
00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:23.458
{\an8}- You steal all that?
- Heck yeah. Perks of the job. Am I right?

34
00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:26.253
Yeah. As a little boy.
I saw the musical. <i>Oliver.</i>

35
00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:27.963
Then I saw <i>Aladdin</i> as a teenager.

36
00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:30.465
